flowchart LR
    U[User] --> I[CLI Input]
    I --> G[Input Guardrail]
    D[Local Documents] --> X[Index and Chunk]
    X --> R[TF-IDF Retriever]
    G --> R
    R --> C[Retrieved Context]
    C --> S[Source-Grounded Synthesizer]
    S --> V[Confidence and Citation Check]
    V --> O[Answer and Sources]
    O --> U
    V --> L[JSON Interaction Log]
    H[Human Reviewer] -. samples/reviews .-> L
    T[Reliability Harness] -. tests .-> G
    T -. tests .-> R
    T -. tests .-> V
